Upstream-Name: oans
Upstream-Contact: https://github.com/martinus/oans
Source: https://github.com/martinus/oans
Comment:
 rynas-oans is oans built unmodified from a pinned upstream release, packaged for rynas
 (https://github.com/rylos/rynas, packaging/oans). oans is a fork of duperemove. rynas
 (AGPL-3.0-or-later) only executes this program as a separate process with command-line
 arguments and reads its output; no oans code is linked into rynas.
 .
 The corresponding source of this package is the upstream release tarball named in
 packaging/oans/versions.env (with its SHA-256) together with packaging/oans/, both
 published next to the package.

